{"id":"00185","root":"uni00185_1","name":{"ja":"矢車弥右衛門","en":"Yaguruma Yaemon"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"矢車弥右衛門","en":"Yaguruma Yaemon"},"aliases":["Yasha Yaemon"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":null,"limited":false,"characterId":146,"profile":{"ja":"上忍。ふうま八将が一角・二車家を支える幹部。異能系の忍法・隠れ身の術“無形秘擬”の使い手であり、水以外の無機物と一体化する事ができる。また、それらを利用して自分そっくりの人形を作り、操って敵を攻撃する事ができる。一体化中は移動する事しかできないが、例えば腕や足だけ一体化を解き攻撃する事が可能。矢車は“無形秘擬”で音も無く忍び寄り、鍛え上げられた肉体とその剛力で敵を素手で粉砕するという。","en":"(Yaguruma Yaemon, he/him) Upper-rank ninja. He is a senior officer supporting the Nika family as one of Fuuma's Eight Generals. He wields the anomalous ninjutsu \"Formless Secret Technique,\" allowing him to merge with inorganic matter other than water. He can also use this ability to craft a doll that looks just like him and control it to attack enemies. While merged, he can only move, but he can release parts such as an arm or leg to strike. Yaguruma sneaks up silently with \"Formless Secret Technique\" and crushes foes with his hardened body and raw strength, smashing them bare-handed."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":null,"forms":[{"id":"uni00185_1","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","levelMax":40,"stats":{"hp":[602,1204],"sp":[100,100],"atk":[82,164],"def":[65,130],"spd":[30,30],"luck":[0,0]},"spCharge":55,"skills":["1","170002"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},"170002":{"slot":"skill1","id":170002,"name":{"ja":"豪腕の強襲"},"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で混乱状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で混乱状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵